<div class="about-hero-strict">
  <div class="container about-hero-inner">
    <div class="about-hero__content">
      <div class="caption caption--mint">OUR MISSION</div>
      <h1>The Science of Radiance</h1>
      <p>Redefining skincare through advanced molecular research and clinical-grade engineering. Neoglyn was founded with a singular purpose: to democratize access to dermatologist-level technology without compromising on aesthetic elegance.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-hero__image">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581093458791-9f3c3900df4b?q=80&w=600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Neoglyn Research">
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="about-values-strict">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <h2>The Neoglyn Standard</h2>
    <div class="values-grid">
      <div class="value-item">
        <div class="value-icon">01</div>
        <h3>Efficacy First</h3>
        <p>Every device is backed by independently verified clinical trials. We measure success in measurable results.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-item">
        <div class="value-icon">02</div>
        <h3>Precision Engineering</h3>
        <p>Built with aerospace-grade materials to ensure lifelong durability and exact wavelength output.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-item">
        <div class="value-icon">03</div>
        <h3>Radical Transparency</h3>
        <p>No proprietary blends or hidden mechanisms. We publish our clinical data and component sourcing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.about-hero-strict {
  padding: 100px 0;
}
.about-hero-inner {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 80px;
}
.about-hero__content {
  flex: 1;
}
.about-hero__content h1 {
  font-size: 56px;
  line-height: 1.1;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
  letter-spacing: -1px;
}
.about-hero__content p {
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  opacity: 0.8;
}
.about-hero__image {
  flex: 1;
  border-radius: 20px;
  overflow: hidden;
  position: relative;
  aspect-ratio: 3/4;
}
.about-hero__image img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
}

.about-values-strict {
  background-color: var(--color-secondary-bg);
  padding: 100px 0;
}
.about-values-strict h2 {
  font-size: 36px;
  margin-bottom: 60px;
}
.values-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 40px;
}
.value-icon {
  font-size: 48px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--color-borders);
  line-height: 1;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.value-item h3 {
  font-size: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.value-item p {
  opacity: 0.7;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .about-hero-inner {
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .about-hero__content h1 {
    font-size: 40px;
  }
  .values-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
  }
}
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "About Strict",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
